{"seq":1,"slug":"asr-pipeline","title":"ASR 流水线","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/ai-speech-audio/speech-recognition/asr-pipeline","wordCount":805,"readingTime":4,"html":"<h1 id=\"asr-流水线\">ASR 流水线</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>自动语音识别（Automatic Speech Recognition, ASR）是将人类语音信号转换为文本的技术。ASR 流水线从原始音频出发，经过预处理、特征提取、声学建模、语言建模和解码等阶段，最终输出文本序列。近年来，端到端（End-to-End）模型逐渐替代了传统的模块化流水线，但理解完整的 ASR 处理链路仍然是优化系统性能的基础。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    A[原始音频] --&gt; B[预处理]&#10;    B --&gt; C[特征提取]&#10;    C --&gt; D[声学模型]&#10;    D --&gt; E[解码器]&#10;    E --&gt; F[语言模型]&#10;    F --&gt; G[文本输出]&#10;    B --&gt; B1[VAD / 降噪]&#10;    C --&gt; C1[MFCC / Mel 频谱]&#10;    D --&gt; D1[CTC / Attention]\">graph LR\n    A[原始音频] --&gt; B[预处理]\n    B --&gt; C[特征提取]\n    C --&gt; D[声学模型]\n    D --&gt; E[解码器]\n    E --&gt; F[语言模型]\n    F --&gt; G[文本输出]\n    B --&gt; B1[VAD / 降噪]\n    C --&gt; C1[MFCC / Mel 频谱]\n    D --&gt; D1[CTC / Attention]</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>技术范式</th>\n<th>架构</th>\n<th>代表模型</th>\n<th>优势</th>\n<th>劣势</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>传统模块化</td>\n<td>AM + PM + LM + 解码器</td>\n<td>Kaldi/GMM-HMM</td>\n<td>可解释性强</td>\n<td>模块间误差传播</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>混合模型</td>\n<td>DNN-HMM</td>\n<td>Kaldi/DNN</td>\n<td>性能提升大</td>\n<td>仍需 HMM 框架</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>CTC 端到端</td>\n<td>编码器 + CTC 损失</td>\n<td>DeepSpeech, wav2vec 2.0</td>\n<td>简化训练</td>\n<td>条件独立假设</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Attention 端到端</td>\n<td>编码器-解码器</td>\n<td>Whisper, Conformer</td>\n<td>最高精度</td>\n<td>非流式推理</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Transducer</td>\n<td>编码器 + 预测网络 + Joint</td>\n<td>RNN-T, Zipformer</td>\n<td>流式友好</td>\n<td>训练复杂</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"音频特征提取\">音频特征提取</h2><p>特征提取将时域音频信号转换为适合模型处理的频域表示。梅尔频谱（Mel Spectrogram）和 MFCC 是两种最常用的特征：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"import librosa&#10;import numpy as np&#10;&#10;audio, sr = librosa.load(&quot;speech.wav&quot;, sr=16000)&#10;&#10;# 短时傅里叶变换（STFT）&#10;stft = librosa.stft(audio, n_fft=512, hop_length=160, win_length=400)&#10;magnitude = np.abs(stft)&#10;&#10;# 梅尔频谱图&#10;mel_spec = librosa.feature.melspectrogram(&#10;    y=audio, sr=sr,&#10;    n_fft=512, hop_length=160, win_length=400,&#10;    n_mels=80, fmin=0, fmax=8000&#10;)&#10;log_mel = librosa.power_to_db(mel_spec)&#10;&#10;# MFCC（梅尔频率倒谱系数）&#10;mfcc = librosa.feature.mfcc(&#10;    y=audio, sr=sr,&#10;    n_mfcc=13, n_fft=512, hop_length=160&#10;)&#10;delta_mfcc = librosa.feature.delta(mfcc)&#10;delta2_mfcc = librosa.feature.delta(mfcc, order=2)&#10;features = np.concatenate([mfcc, delta_mfcc, delta2_mfcc], axis=0)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> librosa</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> numpy </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">as</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> np</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">audio, sr </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> librosa.load(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"speech.wav\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">sr</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">16000</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 短时傅里叶变换（STFT）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">stft </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> librosa.stft(audio, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">n_fft</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">512</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">hop_length</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">160</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">win_length</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">400</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">magnitude </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> np.abs(stft)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 梅尔频谱图</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">mel_spec </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> librosa.feature.melspectrogram(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    y</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">audio, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">sr</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">sr,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    n_fft</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">512</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">hop_length</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">160</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">win_length</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">400</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    n_mels</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">80</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">fmin</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">fmax</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">8000</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">log_mel </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> librosa.power_to_db(mel_spec)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># MFCC（梅尔频率倒谱系数）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">mfcc </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> librosa.feature.mfcc(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    y</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">audio, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">sr</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">sr,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    n_mfcc</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">13</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">n_fft</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">512</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">hop_length</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">160</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">delta_mfcc </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> librosa.feature.delta(mfcc)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">delta2_mfcc </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> librosa.feature.delta(mfcc, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">order</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">features </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> np.concatenate([mfcc, delta_mfcc, delta2_mfcc], </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">axis</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span></code></pre></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>特征</th>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>信息保留</th>\n<th>计算量</th>\n<th>典型应用</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>原始波形</td>\n<td>1</td>\n<td>全部</td>\n<td>最小</td>\n<td>wav2vec 2.0</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>STFT 频谱</td>\n<td>n_fft/2+1</td>\n<td>全频率</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>通用分析</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Mel 频谱</td>\n<td>n_mels (80)</td>\n<td>感知相关</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>Whisper, Conformer</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>MFCC</td>\n<td>n_mfcc (13×3)</td>\n<td>包络信息</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>传统 ASR</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>滤波器组 (Fbank)</td>\n<td>n_mels (80)</td>\n<td>感知相关</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>大多数端到端模型</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"ctc-解码原理\">CTC 解码原理</h2><p>CTC（Connectionist Temporal Classification）是端到端 ASR 的核心解码框架。它引入空白符（blank）来解决输入序列和输出序列长度不对齐的问题：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"# CTC 解码示例&#10;# 模型输出（每帧一个概率分布）：&#10;# 帧1: h(0.8) e(0.1) blank(0.1)&#10;# 帧2: h(0.1) e(0.7) blank(0.2)&#10;# 帧3: e(0.1) l(0.6) blank(0.3)&#10;# 帧4: l(0.7) o(0.2) blank(0.1)&#10;# 帧5: l(0.2) o(0.6) blank(0.2)&#10;&#10;# CTC 路径合并规则：&#10;# 1. 去除所有 blank&#10;# 2. 合并连续重复字符&#10;# &quot;hh-ell-lo&quot; → &quot;hello&quot;&#10;# &quot;h-e-l-l-o&quot; → &quot;hello&quot;&#10;&#10;# 贪心解码&#10;def ctc_greedy_decode(log_probs, blank_id=0):&#10;    best_path = np.argmax(log_probs, axis=-1)&#10;    decoded = []&#10;    prev = blank_id&#10;    for token in best_path:&#10;        if token != blank_id and token != prev:&#10;            decoded.append(token)&#10;        prev = token&#10;    return decoded&#10;&#10;# Beam Search 解码（更准确）&#10;def ctc_beam_search(log_probs, beam_width=10, blank_id=0):&#10;    # 维护 beam_width 个候选路径&#10;    # 每步扩展，合并等价路径，保留 top-k&#10;    pass\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># CTC 解码示例</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 模型输出（每帧一个概率分布）：</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 帧1: h(0.8) e(0.1) blank(0.1)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 帧2: h(0.1) e(0.7) blank(0.2)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 帧3: e(0.1) l(0.6) blank(0.3)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 帧4: l(0.7) o(0.2) blank(0.1)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 帧5: l(0.2) o(0.6) blank(0.2)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># CTC 路径合并规则：</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 1. 去除所有 blank</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 2. 合并连续重复字符</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># \"hh-ell-lo\" → \"hello\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># \"h-e-l-l-o\" → \"hello\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 贪心解码</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> ctc_greedy_decode</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(log_probs, blank_id</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    best_path </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> np.argmax(log_probs, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">axis</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=-</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    decoded </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> []</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    prev </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> blank_id</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> token </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">in</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> best_path:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> token </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">!=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> blank_id </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">and</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> token </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shi