H[声学分数 + LM 分数加权]\">graph TD\n    A[声学模型输出] --&gt; B{解码策略}\n    B --&gt;|简单快速| C[贪心解码]\n    B --&gt;|准确度更高| D[Beam Search]\n    B --&gt;|结合语言模型| E[Beam Search + LM]\n    C --&gt; F[逐帧取 argmax]\n    D --&gt; G[维护 Top-K 候选]\n    E --&gt; H[声学分数 + LM 分数加权]</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>解码方法</th>\n<th>时间复杂度</th>\n<th>精度</th>\n<th>延迟</th>\n<th>适用场景</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>贪心解码</td>\n<td>O(T)</td>\n<td>基准</td>\n<td>最低</td>\n<td>实时场景</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Beam Search</td>\n<td>O(T×B)</td>\n<td>+5-10%</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>离线转录</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Beam + LM</td>\n<td>O(T×B×V)</td>\n<td>+10-20%</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>高精度需求</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>LM Rescoring</td>\n<td>O(N)</td>\n<td>+5-15%</td>\n<td>后处理</td>\n<td>两遍解码</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"声学模型架构演进\">声学模型架构演进</h2><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"# Conformer 编码器（Transformer + 卷积的混合架构）&#10;# 2020 年 Google 提出，成为 ASR 声学模型的标准选择&#10;&#10;# Conformer Block =&#10;#   Feed Forward Module (1/2)&#10;#   + Multi-Head Self-Attention Module&#10;#   + Convolution Module&#10;#   + Feed Forward Module (1/2)&#10;#   + LayerNorm&#10;&#10;# PyTorch 伪代码&#10;class ConformerBlock(nn.Module):&#10;    def __init__(self, d_model, n_heads, conv_kernel_size):&#10;        self.ff1 = FeedForward(d_model)&#10;        self.attn = MultiHeadAttention(d_model, n_heads)&#10;        self.conv = ConvolutionModule(d_model, conv_kernel_size)&#10;        self.ff2 = FeedForward(d_model)&#10;        self.norm = nn.LayerNorm(d_model)&#10;&#10;    def forward(self, x, mask=None):&#10;        x = x + 0.5 * self.ff1(x)&#10;        x = x + self.attn(x, mask=mask)&#10;        x = x + self.conv(x)&#10;        x = x + 0.5 * self.ff2(x)&#10;        return self.norm(x)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A7